---
<h2>Own the cards</h2>
<p>Ghost can inject a default stylesheet and script for its cards. That stylesheet is <em>unlayered</em>, so it would beat every rule in this system. Turn it off in the theme's <code>package.json</code>, and load the system's small replacement for the script:</p>
{{{{code "json"}}}}
{
  "config": {
    "card_assets": false
  }
}
{{{{/code}}}}
{{{{code "hbs"}}}}
<script src="{{asset "js/im-content.js"}}" defer></script>
{{{{/code}}}}
<p><code>im-content.js</code> (~2 KB) does what Ghost's script did — gallery proportions, the toggle, the audio and video players — and two things it did not: scrolling tables and click-to-zoom. A post is fully readable without it.</p>

<h2>Bookmark</h2>
<p>A link, previewed. It fills on hover — the system's one hover. In a narrow column the picture moves above the words (a container query, so it answers to the column, not the screen).</p>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-content im-content-flush">
	<figure class="kg-card kg-bookmark-card"><a class="kg-bookmark-container" href="#bookmark"><div class="kg-bookmark-content"><div class="kg-bookmark-title">{{demo.three.[0].title}}</div><div class="kg-bookmark-description">{{demo.three.[0].excerpt}} The longer this description runs, the more clearly you can see that it is held to two lines and then cut with an ellipsis.</div><div class="kg-bookmark-metadata"><img class="kg-bookmark-icon" src="{{demo.author.profile_image}}" alt=""><span class="kg-bookmark-author">{{demo.author.name}}</span><span class="kg-bookmark-publisher">imswarnil.com</span></div></div><div class="kg-bookmark-thumbnail"><img src="{{demo.three.[0].feature_image}}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></a></figure>
</div>
{{/example}}

<h2>Callout</h2>
<p>A ground in the kind's tint with a matching hairline, and the emoji in its own tile. <strong>No coloured bar down one side.</strong> The editor's nine colours map onto the system's status tokens, so they follow dark mode.</p>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-content im-content-flush">
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-grey"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">📌</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Grey — the default. A note that is useful but not urgent.</div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-blue"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">💡</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Blue — <strong>good to know</strong>. Links <a href="#callout">look like this</a> inside one.</div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-green"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">✅</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Green — it worked.</div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-yellow"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">⚠️</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Yellow — back up the database before you run this.</div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-red"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">⛔</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Red — this cannot be undone.</div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-callout-card kg-callout-card-accent"><div class="kg-callout-emoji">✨</div><div class="kg-callout-text">Accent — in the site's own colour.</div></div>
</div>
{{/example}}
<p>Also <code>-white</code>, <code>-pink</code> and <code>-purple</code>. With the emoji switched off in the editor the tile is simply not printed.</p>

<h2>Toggle</h2>
<p>A ruled row that opens. Consecutive toggles share a rule, so a run of them reads as one FAQ, not a stack of boxes.</p>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-content im-content-flush">
	<div class="kg-card kg-toggle-card" data-kg-toggle-state="close"><div class="kg-toggle-heading"><h4 class="kg-toggle-heading-text">Do I need a visa to work in Hungary?</h4><button class="kg-toggle-card-icon" aria-label="Expand toggle to read content"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 9l7 7 7-7"/></svg></button></div><div class="kg-toggle-content"><p>From outside the EU, yes — a residence permit for the purpose of employment. Your employer starts it; you finish it at the consulate.</p></div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-toggle-card" data-kg-toggle-state="close"><div class="kg-toggle-heading"><h4 class="kg-toggle-heading-text">How long does it take?</h4><button class="kg-toggle-card-icon" aria-label="Expand toggle to read content"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 9l7 7 7-7"/></svg></button></div><div class="kg-toggle-content"><p>Plan for ten weeks from the signed contract to the stamp. Mine took seven.</p></div></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-toggle-card" data-kg-toggle-state="open"><div class="kg-toggle-heading"><h4 class="kg-toggle-heading-text">Can my family come with me?</h4><button class="kg-toggle-card-icon" aria-label="Expand toggle to read content"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 9l7 7 7-7"/></svg></button></div><div class="kg-toggle-content"><p>Yes, through family reunification, once your own permit is issued.</p></div></div>
</div>
{{/example}}

<h2>Button</h2>
{{#example code=false}}
<div class="im-content im-content-flush">
	<div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a href="#button" class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent">Download the checklist</a></div>
	<div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-left"><a href="#button" class="kg-btn">A default button, left-aligned</a></div>
</div>
{{/example}}
<p>The system's button under the editor's class names: a pill, ink by default, the accent with <code>kg-btn-accent</code>.</p>

